COM to execute Excel4 macros remotely","dataset":"SDWIN-200917174542","recording":"covenant_dcom_executeexcel4macro_allowed_2020-09-17174542"},"nightwatch":{"techniques":["T1571","T1053.005","T1071.001"],"verdict":{"assessment":"An operator deployed a Grunt HTTP C2 agent on WORKSTATION5 that executed a tool connecting to an external IP, while simultaneously on WORKSTATION6 a suspicious Excel process was spawned by svchost and made network connections to multiple external IPs, with a scheduled task created for persistence.","findings":[{"technique_id":"T1571","name":"Non-Standard Port","parent":null,"tactics":["Command and Control"],"behavior":"GruntHTTP C2 agent on WORKSTATION5 executed MoveExcel4.exe tool to establish network connection to external IP 172.18.39.6 on port 49603.","slot":0,"reasoning":"MoveExcel4.exe initiated a direct network connection to an external IP on port 49603, which is an uncommon port for standard protocols. This represents the use of a non-standard port for command and control communications rather than proxying or dynamic resolution.","evidence":[{"event_id":"E010","field":"CommandLine","quote":"\"cmd.exe\" /c C:\\Users\\pgustavo\\Desktop\\MoveExcel4.exe 172.18.39.6","ok":true},{"event_id":"E018","field":"DestinationIp","quote":"172.18.39.6","ok":true},{"event_id":"E018","field":"DestinationPort","quote":"49603","ok":true}],"attempts":1},{"technique_id":"T1053.005","name":"Scheduled Task","parent":"Scheduled Task/Job","tactics":["Execution","Persistence","Privilege Escalation"],"behavior":"Scheduled task 'OneDrive Standalone Update Task' created by user sbeavers on WORKSTATION6 for persistence.","slot":2,"reasoning":"The evidence shows a scheduled task created by user sbeavers with a name mimicking legitimate OneDrive functionality. This is a direct use of Windows Task Scheduler for persistence, matching T1053.005 (Scheduled Task) rather than masquerading alone, since the primary objective is establishing persistence through task schedul